warning[R0013] (conservative): `totals` is written to, but never read
--> 11:8: `totals` declared here
    16:3: `totals` is only written to
    18:2: `totals` is only written to
  = note: every use of `totals` stores a field in it, and the table is never read or passed on, so nothing can see what was stored; Rime cannot tell leftover clutter from a table that was meant to be returned
  = help: delete it and the writes to it, or rename to `_totals` if the binding is deliberate
